  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flood Alleviation and Drainage Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Mitigacion y Sistemas de Drenaje</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this programme is the reduction of flood risk by improving the management of the water resource in the drainage channels through development of the built infrastructure. Components include: (i) upgrade of drainage infrastructure in Port of Spain and in particular East Port of Spain; (ii) watershed management in the East-West Corridor; and (iii) change management and capacity building of the Ministry of the Environment and Water Resources.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
